        "code": "// Calls timeline1's actions and reads its values by name, as RunJS code in a saved app does.\nawait components.timeline1.setLoading(true);\nawait components.timeline1.setLoading(false);\nawait components.timeline1.setDisable(true);\nawait components.timeline1.setDisable(false);\nawait components.timeline1.setVisibility(false);\nawait components.timeline1.setVisibility(true);\nreturn { \"isVisible\": components.timeline1.isVisible, \"isLoading\": components.timeline1.isLoading, \"isDisabled\": components.timeline1.isDisabled, \"lastClickedItem\": components.timeline1.lastClickedItem };",
